{"title": "Region", "pageid": 10599, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Region", "categories": ["Regions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Regions</b> represent the largest <a href=\"/wiki/Area\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Areas</a> of the game. They contain all <a href=\"/wiki/Locations\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Locations\">Locations</a> that are included and connected under the same <a href=\"/wiki/Map\" title=\"Map\">Map</a>. They are usually the main settings of an Act.  \n</p><p>The regions in Baldur's Gate 3, by Act are:\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Prologue\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prologue\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prologue\">Prologue</a></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_One\"><a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wilderness\" title=\"Wilderness\">Wilderness</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery_Trail\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery Trail\">Rosymorn Monastery Trail</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Two\"><a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowfell\" title=\"Shadowfell\">Shadowfell</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\"><a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Fortress\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Fortress\">Wyrm's Rock Fortress</a></li>\n<li><a hr